<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:auto;color:#0f172a">
  <h2 style="color:#1d4ed8">Reset your password</h2>
  <p>Hello <%= @customer.first_name %>, we received a request to reset the password of your <%= @company %> account.</p>
  <p style="margin:24px 0"><a href="<%= @link %>" style="background:#2563eb;color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold">Choose a new password</a></p>
  <p>This link works for 2 hours and only once. If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all"><%= @link %></span></p>
  <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px">If you did not ask for this, ignore this e-mail – your password stays as it is. – <%= @company %></p>
</div>
